1
00:00:02,064 --> 00:00:04,525
Even if it makes you suffer,

2
00:00:04,525 --> 00:00:10,156
you're wonderful because you can't just
abandon things that are important to you.

3
00:00:11,824 --> 00:00:13,826
Mukai...

4
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:16,287
Show me your hand!

5
00:00:17,705 --> 00:00:21,625
This is from trying to light the fire.

6
00:00:23,085 --> 00:00:25,588
For my sake...

7
00:00:27,214 --> 00:00:29,800
Mukai, just why?

8
00:00:33,012 --> 00:00:36,515
I won't be able to hold back my feelings.

9
00:00:58,662 --> 00:01:01,916
I really went too far!

10
00:01:01,916 --> 00:01:04,126
Shino?

11
00:01:06,754 --> 00:01:08,339
What were you doing?

12
00:01:08,964 --> 00:01:11,425
Uh, well...

13
00:01:11,425 --> 00:01:14,512
What should I do to trick him?

14
00:01:14,512 --> 00:01:16,889
You know...

15
00:01:16,889 --> 00:01:19,642
It was my first time!

16
00:01:19,642 --> 00:01:20,267
Huh?

17
00:01:20,267 --> 00:01:21,602
Not that!

18
00:01:21,602 --> 00:01:26,148
Where did my top-ranked
student brain go?!

19
00:01:26,982 --> 00:01:29,944
Are you ready to fall in
fall in love with me?

20
00:01:29,944 --> 00:01:34,115
I wanna let you know when
I have a crush on you! You!

21
00:01:36,075 --> 00:01:39,036
A throbbing development
is a maiden's desire!

22
00:01:39,036 --> 00:01:40,287
Is admiration not enough?

23
00:01:40,287 --> 00:01:42,081
It is not exciting enough!

24
00:01:42,081 --> 00:01:44,959
A beam of love that heals the world

25
00:01:44,959 --> 00:01:47,920
I want to be loved, I want to be in love

26
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,338
Such ambiguous impulse

27
00:01:49,338 --> 00:01:50,673
I miss you! How about you?

28
00:01:50,673 --> 00:01:53,217
Notice my gaze

29
00:01:53,968 --> 00:01:56,887
I see the future where I am with you

30
00:01:56,887 --> 00:01:58,889
My dream is getting bigger

31
00:01:58,889 --> 00:02:02,184
The feelings I have been hiding
just popped out

32
00:02:02,184 --> 00:02:05,396
This heart of mine becomes noisy
when it is just the two of us

33
00:02:05,396 --> 00:02:10,818
Although you won't notice
since you are so dense

34
00:02:10,818 --> 00:02:17,032
I know that I am not the one
you are looking at

35
00:02:17,032 --> 00:02:20,244
Still, I cannot stop wishing for

36
00:02:20,244 --> 00:02:23,831
a love story with you

37
00:02:24,456 --> 00:02:27,668
I want to fall in love dramatically

38
00:02:27,668 --> 00:02:30,546
I want to love you romantically

39
00:02:30,546 --> 00:02:36,468
I want you to take me for real
and fall in love with you

40
00:02:36,468 --> 00:02:39,513
Choose me in a roundabout way

41
00:02:39,513 --> 00:02:42,641
Make me laugh with a happy ending

42
00:02:42,641 --> 00:02:45,644
There is a view I want to see with you

43
00:02:45,644 --> 00:02:48,439
I would rather be next to you

44
00:02:48,439 --> 00:02:50,316
Just keep that in mind

45
00:02:58,991 --> 00:03:02,369
For now, I have to trick him.

46
00:03:02,912 --> 00:03:06,415
Instead of just focusing on
hiding your feelings,

47
00:03:06,415 --> 00:03:10,836
you should worry about not
losing sight of what you want.

48
00:03:13,047 --> 00:03:18,385
Maybe I should confess
my true feelings, right now?

49
00:03:22,348 --> 00:03:23,557
I'm scared.

50
00:03:24,308 --> 00:03:26,227
Shino?

51
00:03:28,187 --> 00:03:33,108
But I feel I won't be able to say it again
if I don't do it now.

52
00:03:34,193 --> 00:03:35,819
Mukai!

53
00:03:36,654 --> 00:03:39,865
The truth is...

54
00:03:44,328 --> 00:03:46,789
All this time, I've been...

55
00:03:46,789 --> 00:03:48,999
Wait a minute, Shino!

56
00:03:48,999 --> 00:03:51,293
I can't wait anymore!

57
00:03:51,293 --> 00:03:52,795
I mean...

58
00:03:52,795 --> 00:03:54,129
You're naked!

59
00:03:57,591 --> 00:04:01,262
No!

60
00:04:01,262 --> 00:04:02,638
Sorry, I saw everything.

61
00:04:02,638 --> 00:04:03,973
Don't say it!

62
00:04:10,562 --> 00:04:12,773
Why...

63
00:04:12,773 --> 00:04:16,944
Why does this always happen to me
when I'm with him?

64
00:04:17,569 --> 00:04:21,907
Was that, the usual accident?

65
00:04:21,907 --> 00:04:24,243
Like when you slip and fall?

66
