Right?

67
00:04:28,205 --> 00:04:30,749
You wouldn't do something like that.

68
00:04:32,710 --> 00:04:33,669
Yeah.

69
00:04:35,337 --> 00:04:37,381
This is fine.

70
00:04:37,381 --> 00:04:40,634
This love wouldn't ever bear fruit.

71
00:04:42,177 --> 00:04:45,639
I should just stay like this.

72
00:04:47,641 --> 00:04:51,395
Stay close to the fire,
I'll collect more sticks.

73
00:04:52,521 --> 00:04:53,981
It wasn't an accident.

74
00:05:05,242 --> 00:05:08,287
Shino?

75
00:05:09,246 --> 00:05:11,123
What do you mean...

76
00:05:16,879 --> 00:05:18,630
...by that?

77
00:05:22,051 --> 00:05:23,385
Shino!

78
00:05:27,473 --> 00:05:30,976
Saki! I can't find them anywhere!

79
00:05:30,976 --> 00:05:32,936
They don't have their phones with them.

80
00:05:34,104 --> 00:05:36,899
Naoya, Shino...

81
00:05:36,899 --> 00:05:41,195
Damn you forehead!
You dare to steal the start!

82
00:05:41,195 --> 00:05:42,780
Where are you?

83
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,576
Naoya!

84
00:05:47,910 --> 00:05:49,912
Shino!

85
00:05:50,996 --> 00:05:52,790
Where's Saki?

86
00:05:52,790 --> 00:05:56,293
Mirika, Saki's searching over there.

87
00:05:56,293 --> 00:05:57,795
This is bad!

88
00:05:59,213 --> 00:06:03,550
Someone saw Naoya and Shino
were swept away by the sea.

89
00:06:20,192 --> 00:06:23,654
Oh no, your fever is getting higher.

90
00:06:26,698 --> 00:06:28,575
It's just a cold.

91
00:06:28,575 --> 00:06:31,120
It's fine since my body has
cooled down at night.

92
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:36,166
I'm sorry for troubling you.

93
00:06:37,084 --> 00:06:39,878
You didn't even sleep because
you were taking care of me.

94
00:06:39,878 --> 00:06:42,047
This isn't your fault.

95
00:06:43,465 --> 00:06:47,970
You're really kind.

96
00:06:47,970 --> 00:06:52,766
You're not even asking about last night.

97
00:06:53,350 --> 00:06:54,977
Shino...

98
00:06:56,979 --> 00:06:59,982
Everyone is worried about us.

99
00:06:59,982 --> 00:07:01,942
We should go back.

100
00:07:01,942 --> 00:07:03,485
You shouldn't move!

101
00:07:03,485 --> 00:07:06,655
I'll swim back first and call for help.

102
00:07:07,239 --> 00:07:13,871
But I can't cause you more trouble
than this.

103
00:07:19,835 --> 00:07:21,503
Shino!

104
00:07:22,838 --> 00:07:25,757
You're sweating a lot.

105
00:07:25,757 --> 00:07:28,427
Are you still with me, Shino?

106
00:07:30,762 --> 00:07:32,639
Could it be a heatstroke?

107
00:07:33,098 --> 00:07:37,102
I see, you haven't drunk any water
since last night.

108
00:07:38,562 --> 00:07:40,522
My body is so hot.

109
00:07:41,190 --> 00:07:43,066
