110
00:07:43,901 --> 00:07:48,197
I jumped straight into the ocean
and got a cold.

111
00:07:48,197 --> 00:07:52,034
On top of that, a heatstroke too.

112
00:07:52,034 --> 00:07:55,537
I just keep causing trouble for Mukai.

113
00:07:56,246 --> 00:08:01,502
Even if tell him about my feelings now...

114
00:08:12,679 --> 00:08:14,139
Mukai?

115
00:08:15,057 --> 00:08:16,517
What are you doing?

116
00:08:16,517 --> 00:08:19,061
I'll cross the sea while carrying you!

117
00:08:20,521 --> 00:08:24,024
But the distance is so far.
It's dangerous.

118
00:08:24,024 --> 00:08:28,070
Since you have a heatstroke, you need to
go to the hospital as soon as possible.

119
00:08:29,488 --> 00:08:36,954
