128
00:09:31,758 --> 00:09:33,010
Mukai!

129
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:38,432
Are you okay?

130
00:09:40,058 --> 00:09:40,892
Yes!

131
00:09:41,810 --> 00:09:43,604
I'm glad.

132
00:09:43,604 --> 00:09:47,649
Then we should go back to everyone.

133
00:09:47,649 --> 00:09:50,193
Yeah.

134
00:09:51,695 --> 00:09:56,617
Before that, I have to explain
that thing about last night.

135
00:09:56,617 --> 00:09:58,910
Naoya! Shino!

136
00:10:02,873 --> 00:10:04,666
Naoya!

137
00:10:08,462 --> 00:10:11,340
Naoya, are you okay?

138
00:10:11,798 --> 00:10:17,054
I'm sorry I made you worry, Saki.

139
00:10:17,971 --> 00:10:19,348
I'm fine.

140
00:10:19,848 --> 00:10:21,808
