141
00:10:25,145 --> 00:10:26,563
I am so glad.

142
00:10:29,232 --> 00:10:33,236
I've never seen Sakisaki
make a face like that.

143
00:10:33,695 --> 00:10:38,575
We searched for you two all night.

144
00:10:38,992 --> 00:10:41,620
And I heard you were swept away
by the sea...

145
00:10:42,412 --> 00:10:46,541
I was terribly wrong.

146
00:10:48,794 --> 00:10:52,589
I can't imagine what I'd do if
something had happened to you.

147
00:10:52,589 --> 00:10:54,007
Sorry.

148
00:10:54,549 --> 00:11:00,639
Sakisaki, do you really love Mukai?

149
00:11:01,014 --> 00:11:05,352
Please don't disappear suddenly
like that again.

150
00:11:06,186 --> 00:11:12,359
Maybe I actually love Mukai more
than Sakisaki does?

151
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:40,770
I'm really an idiot.

152
00:11:44,725 --> 00:11:47,227
I'm so sorry for making you worry!

153
00:11:47,227 --> 00:11:49,938
I'll do anything to make up for this!

154
00:11:49,938 --> 00:11:52,941
I'm happy that you're safe, okay?

155
00:11:53,900 --> 00:11:56,611
I'm glad that the two of you are safe.

156
00:11:59,114 --> 00:12:03,827
And you know,
we ended up having our kiss.

157
00:12:03,827 --> 00:12:05,454
So all is well.

158
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,582
