159
00:12:08,582 --> 00:12:09,583
Huh?!

160
00:12:10,292 --> 00:12:12,711
About that...

161
00:12:16,298 --> 00:12:19,217
What's with this weird mood?

162
00:12:19,217 --> 00:12:20,802
Well...

163
00:12:21,636 --> 00:12:24,389
Is it that weird?

164
00:12:27,058 --> 00:12:29,478
