166
00:12:31,438 --> 00:12:36,234
Well, about that...

167
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,737
What does it look like to you?

168
00:12:38,737 --> 00:12:41,698
You annoy me!
You two definitely kissed!

169
00:12:43,241 --> 00:12:45,243
Congratulations!

170
00:12:45,243 --> 00:12:46,828
Well...

171
00:12:49,247 --> 00:12:52,667
I told you to stop them!

172
00:12:59,508 --> 00:13:02,177
I guess you did.
Sorry about that.

173
00:13:05,972 --> 00:13:08,640
What was it like?

174
00:13:09,309 --> 00:13:10,727
Salty?

175
00:13:11,937 --> 00:13:14,022
Damn you all!

176
00:13:14,481 --> 00:13:17,400
- Go flirt somewhere else!
- Hey!

177
00:13:20,529 --> 00:13:24,658
She's upset because I kissed Naoya.

178
00:13:30,997 --> 00:13:32,457
What happened?

179
00:13:32,457 --> 00:13:33,333
Huh?

180
00:13:33,333 --> 00:13:37,420
I said I was going to reveal your secret
if you didn't get in their way, didn't I?

181
00:13:37,420 --> 00:13:39,506
Uh, about that...

182
00:13:39,506 --> 00:13:42,676
You were with Naoya
at desert island, right?

183
00:13:42,676 --> 00:13:45,136
Did something happen between you two?

184
00:13:48,473 --> 00:13:52,269
It's as if nothing happened.

185
00:13:52,978 --> 00:13:55,897
I did the usual clumsiness,
and he saw my chest again.

186
00:13:55,897 --> 00:13:59,776
It's amazing that it's included in
the "nothing happened" category of yours.

187
00:14:01,319 --> 00:14:02,779
Then we held hands.

188
00:14:04,739 --> 00:14:08,702
We sat facing away from each other,
naked and next to a bonfire.

189
00:14:12,247 --> 00:14:14,374
And then, I kissed him.

190
00:14:14,374 --> 00:14:16,710
Stop messing with me!

191
00:14:18,044 --> 00:14:19,254
What the heck is that?

192
00:14:19,254 --> 00:14:22,549
Why did I even worry about you?
You made me want to punch you!

193
00:14:23,300 --> 00:14:25,218
Did you go all the way with him?

194
00:14:25,218 --> 00:14:26,636
No, I didn't!

195
00:14:29,556 --> 00:14:32,309
Then, did you confess?

196
00:14:37,314 --> 00:14:39,482
I'm hungry.

197
00:14:39,482 --> 00:14:42,068
Wanna go get something to eat?

198
00:14:42,068 --> 00:14:43,528
That sounds good.

199
00:14:43,528 --> 00:14:44,404
Sure.

200
00:14:44,404 --> 00:14:48,241
