did you confess to him or not?

205
00:15:05,258 --> 00:15:07,052
I was going to.

206
00:15:08,094 --> 00:15:09,554
It wasn't an accident.

207
00:15:11,097 --> 00:15:14,726
But then my sickness worsened,

208
00:15:15,685 --> 00:15:18,813
and Mukai carried me here.

209
00:15:20,523 --> 00:15:24,694
When I saw Sakisaki's crying face
while running on him...

210
00:15:25,195 --> 00:15:26,905
Naoya!

211
00:15:28,114 --> 00:15:30,909
It kinda surprised me a bit.

212
00:15:31,618 --> 00:15:34,621
So I ended up never saying anything.

213
00:15:35,330 --> 00:15:42,170
I actually thought Sakisaki wasn't
that serious about Mukai.

214
00:15:42,170 --> 00:15:43,755
But I was wrong.

215
00:15:44,798 --> 00:15:46,299
What's with that?

216
00:15:48,286 --> 00:15:50,011
It's enough for me.

217
00:15:54,224 --> 00:15:56,434
Shino, listen...

218
00:15:56,851 --> 00:16:01,272
Good timing, I want you to hear it too.

219
00:16:03,775 --> 00:16:07,696
I'll quit my current school.

220
00:16:10,031 --> 00:16:13,368
I'll quit and transfer school.

221
00:16:18,750 --> 00:16:22,653
You're gonna transfer?

222
00:16:23,446 --> 00:16:25,170
Shino?

223
00:16:25,171 --> 00:16:26,089
You...

224
00:16:26,089 --> 00:16:27,173
I see.

225
00:16:27,173 --> 00:16:28,299
Saki?

226
00:16:28,299 --> 00:16:31,261
How can you stay so calm?

227
00:16:31,261 --> 00:16:32,595
Sakisaki.

228
00:16:33,722 --> 00:16:35,306
I'm serious.

229
00:16:35,849 --> 00:16:37,267
Really?!

230
00:16:37,267 --> 00:16:40,937
But why?

231
00:16:44,899 --> 00:16:48,903
I figured that I shouldn't be
around you anymore.

232
00:16:48,903 --> 00:16:50,447
Why?

233
00:16:51,614 --> 00:16:55,410
If I catch your stupidity, I'd have to
start worrying about my future.

234
00:16:55,410 --> 00:16:57,662
I think you caught plenty already?

235
00:16:57,662 --> 00:16:59,247
All the more so then.

236
00:16:59,247 --> 00:17:01,875
She doesn't deny that she's stupid?

237
00:17:01,875 --> 00:17:04,335
But this is still way too sudden.

238
00:17:04,335 --> 00:17:06,296
Did something happen?

239
00:17:07,213 --> 00:17:08,715
Shino.

240
00:17:10,216 --> 00:17:12,260
I just had a lot to think about.

241
00:17:12,260 --> 00:17:16,181
And I'm asking you that, Shino!

242
00:17:17,390 --> 00:17:20,894
I've already made up my mind.

243
00:17:21,770 --> 00:17:23,859
Shino...

244
00:17:23,860 --> 00:17:27,081
We won't see each other
as often from now on.

245
00:17:27,082 --> 00:17:29,072
Make sure to get along
with Mukai, okay?

246
00:17:30,487 --> 00:17:33,031
Thanks for everything.

247
00:17:36,534 --> 00:17:38,286
Shino...

248
00:17:39,454 --> 00:17:42,749
I'll take the next flight home
after this.

249
00:17:42,749 --> 00:17:44,417
Everyone can stay and have fun.

250
00:17:47,837 --> 00:17:51,382
Wait a second, you flat-chested!

251
00:17:52,634 --> 00:17:53,760
Huh?

252
00:17:53,760 --> 00:17:58,598
You think you can convince me
with such a crude explanation?

253
00:17:58,598 --> 00:18:00,433
Saki?!

254
00:18:01,142 --> 00:18:02,352
What do you want?

255
00:18:02,352 --> 00:18:05,438
I want you to stop
looking down on people!

256
00:18:05,438 --> 00:18:09,067
You damn no-breast and
mentally unstable-lolicon-bait woman!

257
00:18:09,067 --> 00:18:11,277
She totally snapped!

258
00:18:13,321 --> 00:18:18,243
If you don't say the truth, I'm gonna
rip off the remaining boobs you have!

259
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:19,451
Wait!

260
00:18:19,452 --> 00:18:20,912
Why groping though?

261
00:18:20,912 --> 00:18:23,581
Saki, calm down!

262
00:18:23,581 --> 00:18:25,375
Let me go!

263
00:18:25,375 --> 00:18:28,339
I don't know what you're hiding from me!

264
00:18:28,340 --> 00:18:33,299
But if you think I'm gonna accept it,
then you're a fool for thinking so!

265
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:35,051
You're a fool!

266
00:18:35,051 --> 00:18:37,052
Foolish!

267
00:18:37,053 --> 00:18:39,389
Those insults are low-level!

268
00:18:39,389 --> 00:18:40,682
Shut up!

269
00:18:40,682 --> 00:18:43,685
Do you also lack imagination
on top of lacking boobs?

270
00:18:43,685 --> 00:18:45,770
You're pathetic!

271
00:18:46,146 --> 00:18:49,190
You don't even have any yourself.

272
00:18:49,858 --> 00:18:52,485
I can do what I want!

273
